   "stem_html": "<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>Joseph is traveling on a road trip. The distance, <span data-math=\"d\">d</span>, he travels before stopping for lunch varies directly with the speed, <span data-math=\"v\">v</span>, he travels. He can travel 120 miles at a speed of 60 mph. How many miles would he travel before stopping for lunch at a rate of 65 mph?</li>\n</ol>",
